// •  Player Physics and Mechanics: I developed the core PlayerMovement system, implementing a physics-based controller that manages speed, 
jumping forces, and gravity through Unity's Rigidbody. I successfully synchronized these physics with the Animator component to ensure visual consistency during movement and jump states.
•  Game Systems Integration: I programmed the logic for the health and scoring systems, 
including a sophisticated collision detection system that distinguishes between different environmental hazards like
 "Lava" and "Obstacles," applying the corresponding penalties to player stats.
•  Audio-Visual Feedback: I implemented a spatial audio system using AudioSource to trigger sound effects for critical game events 
(jumping, coin collection, and Game Over), enhancing the player's immersive experience.
•  UI and Scene Management: I created the MainMenuManager and integrated it with the gameplay loop. 
This included developing the "Game Over" logic that freezes the engine's time scale, calculates final results, and handles UI panel transitions.
•  Metadata and Serialization Management: I managed the technical integrity of the project by maintaining the .
meta files and Global Identifiers (GUIDs) for all scripts, ensuring seamless integration and reference stability within the Unity Editor.
